5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 嗷呜！巨龙咆哮！.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/r9nd14sf4nozp1mujlrh8szlf8rsqj8.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%97%B7%E5%91%9C%EF%BC%81%E5%B7%A8%E9%BE%99%E5%92%86%E5%93%AE%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/r9nd14sf4nozp1mujlrh8szlf8rsqj8.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%97%B7%E5%91%9C%EF%BC%81%E5%B7%A8%E9%BE%99%E5%92%86%E5%93%AE%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f9/r9nd14sf4nozp1mujlrh8szlf8rsqj8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />嗷呜！巨龙咆哮！\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，跳跃至目标地点，并对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">110%</font>范围伤害，每额外命中1名目标，技能倍率降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，最低至<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。攻击后，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">易伤2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]状态，额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；且自身移除所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"炸毛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">炸毛</font></span></span>]，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b5/4cyaxvme10nbxvb0dprbjkm2p12efho.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b5/4cyaxvme10nbxvb0dprbjkm2p12efho.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td s